[{"client_msg_id":"0c591761-53e2-4df8-831c-7e6c52a1f6e2","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"この話なんの本でよんだんだったかなあ　これも面白いんですけど","ts":"1630229569.019500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9mmR5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cb6efae1-6978-41a8-982b-720446ccc858","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"ちなみに、シリコンの表面がどういう構造をとっているのかが何十年も未解決だったんですが、STMの開発によって表面原子構造の直接観測ができるようになって決着しています（1983年）","ts":"1630229525.019000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fZcs7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bb89a81f-3b46-4019-a38c-c0e64705be47","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"まあ、こまかくどう捉えるか気にしだすといろいろあるので、大筋はそうよね","ts":"1630229307.017400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hPZrI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5eeb6980-8c17-417f-9633-726e5e4d84ef","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"統計力学の理論はあくまで統計力学的検証ですから、真の意味で原子を「見た」のは走査プローブ顕微鏡まで待つことになるでしょうね","ts":"1630229256.016600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"VHG8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3f8d0739-5a4d-40fe-aca4-e8dac869f98b","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"分子か原子かはあまり本質的な違いではないんですよね（デモンストレーションとしては大事でしょうが）\n最小単位がある、というのが大事","ts":"1630229156.015200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"KXl4w"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b71b72db-0402-4df8-a188-6803882ba8df","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"どうだろう...そこは詳しくないな...\nいまだと電顕での直接撮像もなくはないしね...","ts":"1630229056.014400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nj6dz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"17cbe81b-880e-42f8-a004-2a65a6d205d5","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"液ヘリで原子論の検証ってなにかあるんですかね？","ts":"1630228977.013800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"x802"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8fb46be9-9fa7-4b63-a775-4f955def2e84","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"まあ、あれがいちばんいいよね","ts":"1630228936.013400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"dLS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fbb1bbfa-d038-436b-b500-237534f11c24","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"ほんとに一個か？っていうのは目では確かめられんだろうと思いますがｗ","ts":"1630228935.013300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gOGx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"deaefa12-dda0-4e3b-b356-14210126d3d0","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"固定的な位置で見れるほうがわかりやすいけど(ブラウン運動が厳密には分子ばっかだし、液体ヘリウムでやるのもつらい)","ts":"1630228909.012800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ouUaB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c9a40a69-d3ea-431f-9820-bf60aed83791","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"今の技術だとマジで見ることもできるようです\n\u003chttps://natgeo.nikkeibp.co.jp/atcl/news/18/021600072/?P=1\u003e","ts":"1630228842.011200","attachments":[{"fallback":"「原子」が見えた！ なんと一眼レフで撮影に成功","id":1,"title":"「原子」が見えた！ なんと一眼レフで撮影に成功","title_link":"https://natgeo.nikkeibp.co.jp/atcl/news/18/021600072/?P=1","text":"一般的なデジタル一眼レフカメラを使って「原子」を撮影することに成功した。その快挙は、英国の工学・物理科学研究会議の科学写真コンテストで表彰された。","image_url":"https://natgeo.nikkeibp.co.jp/atcl/news/18/021600072/ph_thumb.jpg","blocks":null,"service_name":"natgeo.nikkeibp.co.jp","service_icon":"https://natgeo.nikkeibp.co.jp/favicon.ico","from_url":"https://natgeo.nikkeibp.co.jp/atcl/news/18/021600072/?P=1","original_url":"https://natgeo.nikkeibp.co.jp/atcl/news/18/021600072/?P=1"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"hee","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9L19"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b98c68e6-3815-46ce-b174-2dfc69116741","type":"message","user":"